# 015 · Log paging

**Status:** `READY` · **Version:** [v0.1.0](../roadmap.md#v010) · **Part:** Install from images

## What

The log page and the `control_log` MCP tool page through every entry with a cursor, not only the newest 300.

## Why

A log you cannot page through hides the failure you are looking for.

## Done when

- [ ] Paging works in the dashboard and over MCP, with tests.

## Decisions

- 2026-10-19, owner: The audit log needs paging.

## Open questions

None.

## Progress

- 2026-10-19: Goal written from the v0.1.0 release plan.

